      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Yes, rosemary can survive the UAE summer outdoors if its roots do not cook or dry out. Give it a large pot that drains well, morning sun and afternoon shade or shade cloth, and test the mix more often in heatwaves. Water the soil, not the leaves."
