    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "When is the best time to plant rosemary in the UAE?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "The best time to plant rosemary in the UAE is from October to November, at the start of the cooler gardening season. The University of Arizona Extension's herb calendar for the Tucson desert also gives October to November for rosemary. Planting in the cooler months lets the roots establish before the summer heat."
