      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "In the ground, rosemary can grow into a rounded shrub of about 1.2–1.5 m tall and 0.9–1.2 m wide (NC State Extension), and up to about 1.8 m tall and 1.2–1.5 m wide (UF/IFAS). In a pot, and with regular trimming, it stays much smaller (UF/IFAS)."
